evé que celui d'une anomalie"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[492.0, 2947.0], [2124.0, 2959.0], [2124.0, 3005.0], [492.0, 2993.0]], "score": 0.9817638993263245, "text": "significative résultant d'une erreur, car la fraude peut impliquer la collusion, la"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[492.0, 3007.0], [2124.0, 3021.0], [2124.0, 3067.0], [492.0, 3053.0]], "score": 0.9862552881240845, "text": "falsification, les omissions volontaires, les fausses déclarations ou le contournement du"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[491.0, 3068.0], [815.0, 3074.0], [815.0, 3120.0], [490.0, 3114.0]], "score": 0.9968987703323364, "text": "contrôle interne ;"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[214.0, 3140.0], [451.0, 3140.0], [451.0, 3289.0], [214.0, 3289.0]], "score": 0.9985771775245667, "text": "DRB"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[2465.0, 3142.0], [2485.0, 3142.0], [2485.0, 3156.0], [2465.0, 3156.0]], "score": 0.5436456799507141, "text": "au"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[2148.0, 3180.0], [2171.0, 3180.0], [2171.0, 3203.0], [2148.0, 3203.0]], "score": 0.07251957803964615, "text": "E"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[2186.0, 3186.0], [2214.0, 3186.0], [2214.0, 3198.0], [2186.0, 3198.0]], "score": 0.48513033986091614, "text": "•-"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[2218.0, 3177.0], [2263.0, 3182.0], [2260.0, 3208.0], [2215.0, 3203.0]], "score": 0.3888857364654541, "text": "e "}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[2107.0, 3200.0], [2256.0, 3200.0], [2256.0, 3294.0], [2107.0, 3294.0]], "score": 0.7987120747566223, "text": "ORR"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[383.0, 3251.0], [487.0, 3251.0], [487.0, 3287.0], [383.0, 3287.0]], "score": 0.8709360957145691, "text": "ALDIL"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[997.0, 3249.0], [1032.0, 3254.0], [1029.0, 3276.0], [994.0, 3271.0]], "score": 0.21719005703926086, "text": "^"}], "page": 17, "pdf": "CA_843071218_INPI_NA_2022_C__63e00903f1cd45aa671d528d.pdf", "skew_angle": 0.0}